#Data Arrangement:
#For the 4x4 tables, each starting pair needs its own table.
#This is the AA table:  
#			5' --> 3'      
#			    AX
#			    UY
#			3' <-- 5'   
#			    Y->          
#	   	---------------------------- 
#	(X) 	A	C	G	U  
#	 | 	----------------------------
#	 V   
#	(A) 	0.7	0.7	-0.1	0.7
#	(C) 	0.7	0.7	0.7	0.7
#	(G) 	-0.3	0.7	-0.3	0.7
#	(U) 	0.7	0.7	0.7	0.1

#An energy of "." is "infinity," i.e. not allowed.




#		5' --> 3'
		   AX
		   PY
#		3' <-- 5'
#		    Y 
# 	---------------------------- 
	A	C	G	P    
# 	----------------------------  
A	-0.3	-0.3	-1.1	-0.3
C	-0.3	-0.3	-0.3	-0.3
G	-1.3	-0.3	-1.3	-0.3
P	-0.3	-0.3	-0.3	-2.6


#		5' --> 3'
		   CX
		   GY
#		3' <-- 5'
#		    Y 
# 	---------------------------- 
	A	C	G	P    
# 	----------------------------  
A	0.0	0.0	-0.8	0.0
C	0.0	0.0	0.0	0.0
G	-1.0	0.0	-1.0	0.0
P	0.0	0.0	0.0	-2.3


#		5' --> 3'
		   GX
		   CY
#		3' <-- 5'
#		    Y 
# 	---------------------------- 
	A	C	G	P    
# 	----------------------------  
A	0.0	0.0	-0.8	0.0
C	0.0	0.0	0.0	0.0
G	-1.0	0.0	-1.0	0.0
P	0.0	0.0	0.0	-2.3




#		5' --> 3'
		   GX
		   PY
#		3' <-- 5'
#		    Y 
# 	---------------------------- 
	A	C	G	P    
# 	----------------------------  
A	0.2	0.2	-0.6	0.2
C	0.2	0.2	0.2	0.2
G	-0.8	0.2	-0.8	0.2
P	0.2	0.2	0.2	-2.1




#		5' --> 3'
		   PX
		   AY
#		3' <-- 5'
#		    Y 
# 	---------------------------- 
	A	C	G	P    
# 	----------------------------  
A	-0.3	-0.3	-1.1	-0.3
C	-0.3	-0.3	-0.3	-0.3
G	-1.3	-0.3	-1.3	-0.3
P	-0.3	-0.3	-0.3	-2.6




#		5' --> 3'
		   PX
		   GY
#		3' <-- 5'
#		    Y 
# 	---------------------------- 
	A	C	G	P    
# 	----------------------------  
A	0.2	0.2	-0.6	0.2
C	0.2	0.2	0.2	0.2
G	-0.8	0.2	-0.8	0.2
